  "2026-09-07T21:04:57.263Z",codex-pm-ecosystem,"Final local release:check passed using installed CLI/SDK 2026.9.7 and pm-changelog 2026.9.6. Final top-level test report: tests=264, pass=264, fail=0, skipped=0. ℹ all files                |  85.49 |    80.07 |   90.43 | . Coverage is the current reported scope; complete four-dimensional source certification and independent production/privacy/review gates remain open."
  "2026-09-07T22:00:34.583Z",codex-pm-ecosystem,"2026-09-07 UTC dependency follow-up: the separate Dependabot Node-types proposal is incorporated by refreshing the allowed @types/node range to installed/locked 26.5.0 (with undici-types 8.9.0), the registry version now available. The full release:check passed again with the exact installed types and unchanged runtime dependencies, consumer floor and coverage thresholds. Older CLI/changelog proposals are superseded by this single review; no package release or hosted deployment is implied."
